7
00:00:41.619 --> 00:00:46.798
Every optimization tier from CPython and PyPy to Clang, GCC,

8
00:00:46.798 --> 00:00:52.063
and Rustc was checksum-verified on Linux Zen 5 RAPL counters.

9
00:00:55.310 --> 00:01:02.669
